# Binary archive/par2 fixtures in the Rust workspace — the blobs contain CR
# bytes; the root .gitattributes ('* text eol=lf') would strip them on checkout
# and corrupt the archives (9 fixtures had to be restored from upstream for
# exactly this reason).
*.rar binary
*.7z binary
*.par2 binary
*.001 binary
*.002 binary
*.003 binary
